Package: accessmod
Title: Run AccessMod 6 Accessibility Analyses from R
Version: 6.0.0.9001
Authors@R: person("Fred", "Moser", email = "frederic.moser@unige.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A thin wrapper around the AccessMod 6 command line: installs the
    released binary for the platform, imports projects (AccessMod 6 project
    files and AccessMod 5 data archives), lists and edits saved jobs and their
    scenarios, and runs analyses such as merge land cover and travel time on
    a project, returning the runs and their output datasets.
License: LGPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/unige-geohealth/accessmod_rs
BugReports: https://github.com/unige-geohealth/accessmod_rs/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: digest, jsonlite, tools, utils
Suggests: terra, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
